	(text "Standby powers of the always-on components:\n- HT75xx -> 50 uW max\n- TLV1831 -> 12 uW max\n- REF35125 -> 10 uW max\n- IRF9310 -> 60 uW max (drain/source + gate/source leakage)\n- Voltage divider -> 150 uW max\n\nTotal -> 282 uW"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.626 61.722 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "10ee6d01-623f-4c52-8b04-a75ff8ef8198")
	)
	(text "Comparator with hysteresis for low battery cutoff.\nCut off voltage V_off = 12.5V, turn on voltage V_on = 12.8V\nV_ref = 1.25V, R_top = 903.2K, R_bot = 100K, R_H = 4.64M, R_ref = 10K\nThe TLV7031 has an internal hysteresis V_ihys = 2.8mV\n\nk = R_bot / (R_top + R_bot) = 0.099681\na = R_ref / (R_ref + R_H) = 0.002151\n\nV_on = (V_ref * (1 - a) + V_ihys/2) / (k - a) = 12.803V\nV_off = (V_ref * (1 - a) - V_ihys/2) / k = 12.499V\n\nTolerance stackup seem like the turn on/off offset can be +/- 36mV"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 64.77 32.766 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2b021c76-01a7-4dba-b5a6-e96c9a5d1058")
	)
	(text "0.05 Rsense sets charge\ncurrent at 2A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202.184 115.062 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "741a82b6-f048-4196-96c2-a554e076f4b7")
	)
	(text "~{nCHARGING} and ~{nFAULT}\nare open drain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.376 126.492 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "81e45985-1661-4e0a-bdd7-39b018b50236")
	)
	(text "The TLV1831 operates at battery voltage w/\npush-pull outputs, so it can drive the FET\ndirectly. 5mA of minimum drive current means\nthe FET will turn off pretty quickly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.704 62.484 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "88d7931f-5da6-4ab9-913f-556a3aae8474")
	)
	(text "2.0V <= BOOST <= 8.4V\nA series Zener of 6.4V drops the input\nvoltage from battery to [3.6V, 7.4V]\n(assuming BAT of [10.0V, 13.8V])"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.788 128.016 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "88ed4133-b00b-4a8c-8209-f96693068526")
	)
	(text "Battery float voltage\n3.3 * (1 + 1.05/0.330) -> 13.8V\n\nfine for a LiFePo4 battery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.526 157.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e4ce3a8e-4960-4789-a482-89bde87d38f6")
	)
	(text "Lower limit of VIN for charging\n2.7V × (1 + 510K / 100K) -> 16.47V\n\nA \"12V\" solar panel is usually 36 cell, when hot\nthe voltage at maximum power (Vmp) can droop so\n~16.5V is a \"safe\" bet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f25a3687-ab50-42d3-889b-364866298445")
	)
